WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:03.870
ARTHUR BROOKS: I think some of the most
provocative questions that this course

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:06.300
asks are what is happiness?

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.350
Is it a feeling?

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.810
It feels like everybody
thinks they know,

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:12.282
but when they try to put
words to it, they can't.

00:00:12.282 --> 00:00:14.490
After you watch this course,
you'll be able to answer

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.140
that question, what is happiness.

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:19.870
And spoiler alert, it's not a feeling.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:21.400
It's much bigger than that.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.370
It's much deeper than that.

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:27.720
And it's something that we can control
a lot more than we can our feelings.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:31.070
[MUSIC PLAYING]

